  "quests": [
    {
      "ID": "39597",
      "LogTitle": "'The Blessing of the Watchers'",
      "AllowableRaces": "4294967295",
      "LogDescription": "'Speak to Yotnar to receive the blessing of the watchers.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'As is your due for passing the Trial of Might, I will grant you the blessing of the watchers. \\n\\nFurthermore, to aid you in your trials to come, I will bestow upon your artifact the power of the vault\\'s keeper. May it serve you well in your time of need.\\n\\nSpeak to me when you are ready to receive this gift.'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38473",
      "RewardSpell": "0",
      "Flags": "39845896",
      "FlagsEx": "327680"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38612",
      "LogTitle": "'A Grapple a Day'",
      "AllowableRaces": "33555378",
      "LogDescription": "'Pick up a Stormforged Grapple Launcher and meet Dread-Rider Cullen outside the wall of Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'So some old magic vrykul is helping us out? I guess that\\'s good, but this trial of yours might be tricky. You see, the only way up that mountain, is through those big walls.\\n\\nYou know, the ones with the mean-looking drakes on them.\\n\\nI scouted a bit, but couldn\\'t get too far without those drakes trying to make lunch out of poor Duchess. The vrykul have them trained, which can\\'t be good.\\n\\nI say we sneak in. I managed to snag a few grapple launchers earlier. Grab one and meet me outside the city walls.'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38613",
      "RewardSpell": "191831",
      "Flags": "35651592",
      "FlagsEx": "8192"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38611",
      "LogTitle": "'Will of the Thorignir'",
      "AllowableRaces": "33555378",
      "LogDescription": "'Meet with Dread-Rider Cullen outside of Hrydshal to begin the trial of the Thorignir.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'In the summit of storms the dragons await. Born of the gods, they will test your will. \\n\\nThey roost above Hrydshal, where their children serve the Drekirjar. But they are no allies to man or vrykul, and so you must earn their blessing as they see fit.\\n\\nA friend of yours awaits in Hrydshal, no doubt searching for the answers you now possess. Go to her, and together, you will test your might against the storm!'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38612",
      "RewardSpell": "81040",
      "Flags": "39845896",
      "FlagsEx": "8192"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38473",
      "LogTitle": "'Will of the Thorignir'",
      "AllowableRaces": "18875469",
      "LogDescription": "'Meet with Lorna Crowley outside of Hrydshal to begin the trial of the Thorignir.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'In the summit of storms the dragons await. Born of the gods, they will test your will. \\n\\nThey roost above Hrydshal, where their children serve the Drekirjar. But they are no allies to man or vrykul, and so you must earn their blessing as they see fit.\\n\\nA friend of yours awaits in Hrydshal, no doubt searching for the answers you now possess. Go to her, and together, you will test your might against the storm!'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38312",
      "RewardSpell": "81040",
      "Flags": "39845896",
      "FlagsEx": "8192"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38459",
      "LogTitle": "'The Ancient Trials'",
      "AllowableRaces": "33555378",
      "LogDescription": "'Find Havi near Aggramar\\'s Vault.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'<As the raven stares into your eyes, an odd voice fills your mind.>\\n\\nI know who you are, champion, and I know what you seek.\\n\\nCome to me, if you think yourself truly worthy.'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "0",
      "RewardSpell": "0",
      "Flags": "38797320",
      "FlagsEx": "65536"
    },
    {
      "ID": "38312",
      "LogTitle": "'A Grapple a Day'",
      "AllowableRaces": "18875469",
      "LogDescription": "'Pick up a Stormforged Grapple Launcher and meet Lorna Crowley outside the wall of Hrydshal.'",
      "QuestDescription": "'So these trials are what will get us the Aegis, and the next one is on the top of that mountain? That may prove problematic.\\n\\nThe only way I see up the mountain is through that vrykul city, and the gates are shut tight. We should be able to grapple over, though. If you don\\'t have a launcher, I managed to wrangle a spare from one of these vrykul.\\n\\nI\\'ll scout ahead and see if I can find a good spot to get in.'",
      "RewardNextQuest": "38318",
      "RewardSpell": "0",
      "Flags": "37748744",
      "FlagsEx": "8192"
    }
  ],
